              "category": "approved",
              "description": "The post has been reviewed and accepted as-is. The human explicitly or implicitly expresses approval, indicating that no changes are needed.\n\nExample phrases include:\n\n\"Looks good.\"\n\"Go ahead and send it.\"\n\"This works for me.\"\n\"No changes needed.\""
            },
